{"3374720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tales Beyond The Tomb - The Farm's Secret", "steam_appid": 3374720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tales Beyond The Tomb&quot; is a chilling episodic horror series that plunges players into the shadows of real-life cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the atmospheric horror of the 80s and 90s, each episode simulates the frightening experiences of real people, mixing nostalgia with relentless suspense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This is the second episode of the series:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374720/extras/c0d530b44622355b7fd5619868e7ccb0.poster.avif?t=1783817170\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374720/extras/c0d530b44622355b7fd5619868e7ccb0.webm?t=1783817170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374720/extras/c0d530b44622355b7fd5619868e7ccb0.mp4?t=1783817170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode 2: The Farm's Secret</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged into a web of secrets and lies, Samantha seems to be part of a puzzle impossible to solve. What once seemed obvious soon turns into something far more sinister, and the line between villain and victim begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is as it seems. How far will you go to uncover the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Aesthetic –</strong> Step back in time with visuals inspired by classic horror films from the 80s and 90s.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic graphics and immersive environments -</strong> Feel the dread with realistic visuals and frightening scenarios.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player voice activity -</strong> Interaction system with your microphone (no microphone is required to play, but this will increase your immersion and bring a complete experience).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue Text System –</strong> Immerse yourself in the plot with dynamic, narrative dialogue.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive car -</strong> Car driving system completely based on real physics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration experience (walking simulator), where realism is key. Navigate immersive locations, discover disturbing truths, and face your fears.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tales Beyond The Tomb&quot; is a chilling episodic horror series that plunges players into the shadows of real-life cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the atmospheric horror of the 80s and 90s, each episode simulates the frightening experiences of real people, mixing nostalgia with relentless suspense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This is the second episode of the series:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374720/extras/c0d530b44622355b7fd5619868e7ccb0.poster.avif?t=1783817170\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374720/extras/c0d530b44622355b7fd5619868e7ccb0.webm?t=1783817170\" type=